  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Even magic can’t tell when you are lying.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Stone Faced<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Magic divinations do not reveal when you are lying or what emotions you are feeling unless the caster makes a caster level check with a DC equal to 10 + your level or HD + your mythic tier + your Wisdom bonus. Once a caster has failed such a check, he cannot try again (even with other spells) for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc88\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
